  "full_text": "So, partying with Mr. God, because that's all we do. So, Mr. God, we come from the land of the ice and snow from midnight to the hot spring, where the hot spring is blue. Blue eyes come from Neanderthals, by the way. I guess not that it matters. I've been looking around. All the righteous people are brown-eyed. It's true. I looked at the Rolling Stones. There's some brown-eyed people in the Rolling Stones. So, like, restore Britain to its glory when they dominated the cultural domination. The British invasion. Go write some songs, eh? You got a pair? I got a pair. Listen to this, eh? Faded glory, gone from Rome. My head hoary, on my dome. My feet, history.",
